{
    "description": "A value whose low checksum bits are clear is tagged so that the total number of set bits satisfies a fixed parity rule for a chosen tag width (1, 3, 4, or 16 low bits), and the tag is later verified to recover the original value. Setting the tag returns the value with its low bits filled in so the parity rule holds; getting clears and validates those low bits, returning the original value when the rule holds. If a value presented for verification does not satisfy the parity rule (its checksum is broken), verification fails and a neutral error is reported instead of a value.",
    "cases": [
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 1, "value": 0}, "expected_output": "value=1\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 1, "value": 2}, "expected_output": "value=2\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 1, "value": 6}, "expected_output": "value=7\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 1, "value": 10}, "expected_output": "value=11\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 1, "value": 30}, "expected_output": "value=31\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 1, "value": 1}, "expected_output": "value=0\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 1, "value": 7}, "expected_output": "value=6\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 1, "value": 11}, "expected_output": "value=10\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 1, "value": 0}, "expected_output": "error=checksum_broken\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 1, "value": 6}, "expected_output": "error=checksum_broken\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 3, "value": 8}, "expected_output": "value=10\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 3, "value": 10}, "expected_output": "value=8\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 3, "value": 13}, "expected_output": "error=checksum_broken\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 4, "value": 16}, "expected_output": "value=18\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 4, "value": 18}, "expected_output": "value=16\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_set", "width": 16, "value": 65536}, "expected_output": "value=92601\n"},
        {"input": {"op": "parity_get", "width": 16, "value": 92601}, "expected_output": "value=65536\n"}
    ]
}
